5:T45f,Men's Aviator/Bomber Leather Jacket
The jacket is made of genuine cowhide nappa leather.
The leather has a thickness of 1.2 mm.
Thick yet soft leather
The base color of the leather is black.
The fur collar is detachable and made of genuine sheepskin.
The color of the sheepskin is beige.
Soft fur and comfortable to wear against the skin.
The jacket also has a removable thermal lining.
The inner lining is attached to the jacket by a zipper.
The inner lining is made of polyester.
Beneath the thermal lining is a breathable mesh.
Exterior: Two slip pockets / Two zippered straight pockets
Inside: One zippered pocket / One snap-button pocket
There is a small zippered pocket on the left sleeve.
The flight jacket is not only suitable for everyday use but also for motorcycling.
There is also a zipper under the lining, allowing you to connect the jacket to trousers.
This way you can also use the jacket as a combo.
A piece of leather was sewn over the main zipper.
So that the jacket remains windproof even while driving
Loops end at the arm and at the waistband
For the unique bomber jacket look6:T448,"Elaborate eagle embossing in the back area

The leather has a used look for a unique look

The jacket is made of genuine cowhide with a leather thickness of approx. 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm

The leather is thick yet very soft and comfortable to wear

The jacket has 5 protector pockets (back, elbow and shoulder)

The matching protectors are included in the scope of delivery

They have 2 zip pockets on both sleeves

On both sides they have a closure to adjust so that the jacket does not flutter while driving

A rubber band has been worked under the fastener so that the jacket fits snugly

They have 2 inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zip

They also have 2 outer pockets, both pockets can be closed with a zip

The basic colour of the leather is dark brown

They have a buckle on the collar for adjustment

There is a piece of leather under the zip so that the jacket is windproof

All zips are original YKK zips

The collar can be used in 2 variants (as a stand-up collar and as a polo collar for folding)

With protectors on shoulders, elbows and back

All protectors are removable"7:T466,"Men's leather jacket

made from genuine cowhide

