Great modern biker shape, an absolute eye-catcher with the zips.

Sophisticated details and a modern, slightly waisted cut round off the shape and unusual appearance of this special leather jacket.

Silver zips make the biker shape extremely authentic. Zips on the pockets and a stylish collar ensure a cool look and practical benefits.

Lots of great studs on the collar, sleeves, shoulders and lower back

Jacket made from genuine, robust, high-quality, soft cowhide leather

Very good quality and workmanship

Comfortable to wear

Three front pockets with zip

Two deep inside pockets, one of which has a zip

Zip fastening on the cuffs

All outside zips are YKK robust metal zips

Rivets on the collar, sleeves, shoulders and lower back

Leather stability:- 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm

Material:- 100% BEEF LEATHER

Basic colour:-Red

With protectors on shoulders, elbows and back

All protectors are removable"8:T416,"Jacket made of genuine, robust, high-quality, soft cowhide

