atches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nMaximum safety thanks to super strong materials and prepared protectors Pockets with protectors on the back, elbows and shoulders\n\nAll protectors are removable\n\nThe jacket can be pulled tighter on both sides so that it does not flap when riding\n\nFour front pockets with zip\n\nOff-centre front zip\n\nAll outer zips are YKK robust metal zips\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1025-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1049","slug":"grey-motorbike-chopper-leather-jacket-with-protectors-pcp-lj-1049","name":"Grey Motorbike Chopper Leather Jacket with Protectors","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide nappa leather\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is grey or black\n\nThe surface has a vintage look\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nRocker billy collar\n\nQuilted shoulders and sleeves\n\nAdjustable sides with leather straps with buckles\n\nWaist is also adjustable with a belt\n\nThe belt is removable\n\n3 outer pockets with zip\n\n1 outer pocket with press stud\n\n2 inside pockets, one with zip\n\nOne pocket with press stud on the left shoulder\n\nOne zip pocket on the right shoulder\n\nRemovable inner lining\n\nZip fastening\n\nA piece of leather has been used under the main zip (so that the jacket is windproof)\n\nThe main zip can be closed all the way to the top\n\nZips on both cuffs\n\nAll zips are from the company YKK\n\nAll protectors are removable\n\nProtectors on shoulders, elbows and back\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1049-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-103","slug":"retro-motorcycle-leather-jacket-with-green-applique-pcp-lj-103","name":"Retro Motorcycle Leather Jacket with Green Applique","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The style of the past and the technology of today offer an ultra-stylish look thanks to the straight, fitted cut and the quilted shoulders with typical armholes.\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way.\n\nBase Color: Black / Green\n\nMaterial: 100% COWHIDE\n\nLeather Durability: 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nOff-centered front zipper\n\nFour front zippered pockets\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one of which has a zipper\n\nZipper closures at the cuffs\n\nAll exterior zippers are YKK metal zippers\n\nInner Lining: Polyester, removable black quilted lining\n\nJacket is made of genuine, robust, high-quality, soft cowhide\n\nComfortable, sporty fit\n\nWith protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-103-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1029","slug":"retro-motorbike-leather-jacket-with-a-stand-up-collar-pcp-lj-1029","name":"Retro Motorbike Leather Jacket with a Stand-Up Collar","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The style of the old days and the technology of today offers an ultra-sleek look with a straight, body-hugging cut and the quilted shoulders with typical arm rings are beautifully accentuated.\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning in a stylish way.\n\nJacket made from genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approx. 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe jacket is black and has been finished with grey extras\n\nQuilted shoulders\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nMaximum safety thanks to super strong materials and prepared protector pockets with protectors on the back, elbows and shoulders\n\nAll protectors are removable\n\nThe jacket can be pulled tighter on both sides so that it does not flap when riding\n\nFour front pockets with zip\n\nOff-centre front zip\n\nAll outer zips are YKK robust metal zips\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1029-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1030","slug":"retro-vintage-designer-motorbike-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-1030","name":"Retro Vintage Designer Motorbike Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide with a thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nUnique retro used look\n\nThe leather has been finished in a vintage look\n\nQuilted areas on shoulders, upper arms, back and elbows\n\nAdjustable straps at the waist (to prevent the jacket from flapping when riding)\n\nSturdy zip (slanted)\n\nZip at the cuffs\n\nFour outer pockets with zips\n\nTwo inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zip\n\nThe inner lining is removable\n\nThe inside pockets are inside the jacket, not on the inner lining\n\nThere is a zip for the trousers in the jacket (with a counterpart)\n\nA kidney belt has been worked into the back of the back area\n\nThe jacket can be used as a leisure or motorbike jacket\n\nThe jacket is slim fit (waisted men's cut)\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1030-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1004","slug":"studded-biker-leather-jacket-red-pcp-lj-1004","name":"Studded Biker Leather Jacket – Red","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"$7","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1004-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-101","slug":"men-s-retro-motorcycle-leather-jacket-black-white-yellow-pcp-lj-101","name":"Men's Retro Motorcycle Leather Jacket – Black/White, Yellow","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"This jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way.\n\nJacket made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe jacket is black and has been finished with yellow accents\n\nQuilted shoulders\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nThe jacket can be tightened on both sides so it doesn't flap while riding\n\nFour front pockets with zippers\n\nOff-center front zipper\n\nAll external zippers are YKK robust metal zippers\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nWith protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Yellow / White"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-101-1.jpg","https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-101-2.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1033","slug":"men-s-motorbike-biker-leather-jacket-retro-style-black-red-pcp-lj-1033","name":"Men's Motorbike Biker Leather Jacket Retro Style – Black/Red","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\nThe jacket has red appliqués on the shoulders and sleeves\n\nQuilted shoulders\n\nZips have been incorporated into the cuffs\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester (air permeable)\n\nAbove this is a thermal inner lining with a cotton lining\n\nIn the inner lining there is a connecting zip for the trousers (with counterpart)\n\nThe inner lining can be removed using a zip fastener\n\nIdeal for the summer\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which can be closed with a zip\n\nCan be closed with a large zip\n\nAll zips are from the original YKK company\n\nThere is a wind stopper under the main zip (also made of leather)\n\nThere are buckles on the sides to adjust the jacket\n\nProtectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1033-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-119","slug":"nubuck-leather-motorcycle-jacket-pcp-lj-119","name":"Nubuck Leather Motorcycle Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Jacket made of genuine, robust, high-quality, soft buffalo nubuck leather\n\nSporty fit, comfortable to wear\n\nThe style of the past combined with the technology of today offers an ultra-stylish look thanks to the straight, body-hugging cut and the quilted shoulders with typical armholes.\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way.\n\nMaterial: 100% Buffalo Nubuck Leather\n\nLonger cut\n\nInner: Polyester / Mesh\n\nLeather strength: 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nOff-center front zipper\n\nFour front pockets with zippers\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one with zipper\n\nZipper closures on the cuffs\n\nAll exterior zippers are YKK robust metal zippers\n\nMaximum safety thanks to super-strong materials and prepared protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nProtectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-119-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-121","slug":"longer-chopper-motorcycle-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-121","name":"Longer Chopper Motorcycle Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Reverse collar with snap fastener\n\nSlightly tailored fit\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way\n\n100% COWHIDE LEATHER with a leather thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nOff-centered high-closing front zipper\n\nFour front zippered pockets\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one of which is zippered\n\nZippered cuffs\n\nAll exterior zippers are YKK heavy-duty metal zippers\n\nAdjustable belt at waist level\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester, with a removable quilted lining\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nProtectors on shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nProtectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-121-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1034","slug":"retro-biker-motorbike-leather-jacket-black-white-pcp-lj-1034","name":"Retro Biker Motorbike Leather Jacket – Black/White","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\nThe jacket has white applications on the shoulders and sleeves\n\nQuilted shoulders\n\nZips have been incorporated into the cuffs\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester (air permeable)\n\nAbove this is a thermal inner lining with a cotton lining\n\nIn the inner lining there is a connecting zip for the trousers (with counterpart)\n\nThe inner lining can be removed using a zip fastener\n\nIdeal for the summer\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which can be closed with a zip\n\nCan be closed with a large zip\n\nAll zips are from the original YKK company\n\nThere is a wind stopper under the main zip (also made of leather)\n\nThere are buckles on the sides to adjust the jacket\n\nProtectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1034-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-122","slug":"longer-motorcycle-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-122","name":"Longer Motorcycle Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide nappa leather (1.1–1.2 mm thick)\n\nBlack leather – timeless and robust\n\nThick yet soft leather for maximum comfort\n\nRemovable protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nLong cut for additional protection\n\nTwo main zippers for summer and winter use\n\nRemovable polyester lining\n\nElasticated belt at the back for a perfect fit\n\nLapel collar for a classic motorcycle jacket look\n\nPerfect for all seasons\n\nIdeal for long rides and everyday wear\n\nCombination of safety, comfort, and timeless design\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-122-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-135","slug":"men-s-used-look-motorcycle-leather-jacket-with-collar-pcp-lj-135","name":"Men's Used-Look Motorcycle Leather Jacket with Collar","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The jacket is made of genuine cowhide nappa leather.\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThick yet soft leather.\n\nThe base color of the leather is brown.\n\nThe surface has been dyed black.\n\nThis creates a unique used-look.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester.\n\nRemovable thermal lining.\n\n4 outer pockets (all with zippers).\n\n2 inner pockets (one with a zipper).\n\nAll closures are made by YKK.\n\nProtectors on the back, elbows, and shoulders.\n\nProtectors are removable.\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-135-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-780","slug":"motorbike-chopper-fringed-jacket-pcp-lj-780","name":"Motorbike Chopper Fringed Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The smooth leather is made of genuine cowhide\n\nThe rough leather is made of buffalo nubuck leather\n\nLeather stability is 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\nReverse biker collar\n\nOff-centre front zip\n\nFront half belt with buckle fastening\n\nTwo front pockets with zip\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one with zip fastening\n\nEpaulettes with buttons\n\nZip fastening on the cuffs\n\nFringed trim on the lower sleeves and back\n\nTwo conchos at the front\n\nTwo conchos at the back\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-780-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-162","slug":"men-s-genuine-leather-motorcycle-jacket-pcp-lj-162","name":"Men's Genuine Leather Motorcycle Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Blends vintage style with modern technology, offering an ultra-stylish look with a straight, tailored cut and quilted shoulders, beautifully accentuated by signature armholes.\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way.\n\nJacket made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm.\n\nThe jacket is black.\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches.\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable.\n\nThe jacket can be tightened on both sides with a Velcro fastener so it doesn't flap while riding.\n\nTwo arm pockets.\n\nOff-centered front zipper.\n\nAll exterior zippers are YKK robust metal zippers.\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be maintained with everyday care products such as care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nTwo front zippered pockets.\n\nWith protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back.\n\nAll protectors are removable.\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-162-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-171","slug":"men-s-motorbike-leather-jacket-grey-pcp-lj-171","name":"Men's Motorbike Leather Jacket – Grey","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Jacket made from genuine, robust cowhide leather, with a leather thickness of approx. 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is vintage grey\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and / or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one of which has a zip\n\nThe jacket can be tightened on both sides with a Velcro fastener so that it does not flap when riding\n\nTwo front pockets with zip\n\nA piece of leather has been sewn under the front zip to keep the jacket windproof\n\nAll outside zips are YKK robust metal zips\n\nZips on the sleeves so that the gloves also fit under the jacket\n\nStand-up collar with a buckle so that the collar does not flap around when riding\n\nQuilted shoulders\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-171-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-159","slug":"studded-biker-leather-jacket-for-men-pcp-lj-159","name":"Studded Biker Leather Jacket for Men","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"$8","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-159-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1043","slug":"classic-motorbike-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-1043","name":"Classic Motorbike Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\nZip fastening type\n\nA piece of leather has been sewn under the main zip (so that the jacket is windproof)\n\n2 inside pockets one with zip\n\n2 outer pockets with zips\n\nAll zips are from the company YKK\n\nThere are 2 air vents at the front for the summer.\n\nAt the back you have zips so that the wind draws out again and the jacket does not flutter.\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1043-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1015","slug":"classic-motorbike-rockerbilly-jacket-pcp-lj-1015","name":"Classic Motorbike Rockerbilly Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Made from the finest, hard-wearing cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nSturdy zip fastener for closing (original YKK zip)\n\nYou can adjust the jacket at the sides\n\nThe jacket has 5 protector pockets\n\nThe protectors are included in the scope of delivery\n\nYou have 3 outside pockets with zip\n\n2 inside pockets one of them with a zip\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1015-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1036","slug":"motorbike-men-s-leather-jacket-grey-pcp-lj-1036","name":"Motorbike Men's Leather Jacket – Grey","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Genuine cowhide with a leather thickness of 1.2 mm\n\nThe lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nso you can use any trousers as combination trousers\n\nThere is a zip inside the jacket that you can use to connect your trousers\n\nThe counterpart is also included\n\nAt the front you have 2 air passages that you can close with a zip\n\nThere are also zips on the back for ventilation\n\n4 outer pockets can all be closed with a zip\n\n2 inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zip\n\nAll zips are from YKK\n\nThe jacket is adjustable at the sides thanks to Velcro fasteners\n\nIn addition, the jacket has integrated elasticated bands at the sides to make the jacket elasticated at the waist\n\nWith protectors on the shoulders, elbows and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1036-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-778","slug":"motorbike-chopper-fringed-jacket-pcp-lj-778","name":"Motorbike Chopper Fringed Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Jacket made from genuine, robust cowhide leather\n\nLeather thickness from 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nBasic colour: Black\n\nMaterial:- 100% COW LEATHER\n\nLeather stability:- 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nReverse collar\n\nOff-centre front zip\n\nFront half belt with buckle fastening\n\nTwo front pockets with zip\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one with zip fastening\n\nZip fastening on the cuffs\n\nFringed trim on the lower sleeves, front and back\n\nTwo conchos at the front\n\nTwo conchos at the back\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-778-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1035","slug":"men-s-studded-biker-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-1035","name":"Men's Studded Biker Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The jacket is made of genuine leather (cowhide nappa leather)\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester\n\nThree outside pockets with zips\n\nTwo inside pockets one of which is equipped with a zip\n\nAll rivets are riveted through the leather (very sturdy and strong)\n\nAll rivets are nickel free\n\nElasticated sides (so that the jacket has a tailored fit)\n\nProtectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1035-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1060","slug":"retro-motorbike-leather-jacket-red-pcp-lj-1060","name":"Retro Motorbike Leather Jacket – Red","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The jacket is made from genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is red\n\nThe surface has been given a used look\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets\n\nAll pockets are equipped with a zip\n\nThe thermal inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nA connecting zip has been sewn into the jacket\n\nSo you can use any trousers as a connection\n\nThe counterpart for sewing in is included in the scope of delivery\n\n5 protector pockets on the shoulders, elbow and back\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nThere is a Velcro fastener on the sides to adjust the waist\n\nThere is a zip under the Velcro fastener for expansion\n\nEach side can be extended by up to 5 cm\n\nAll zips are from the company YKK\n\nPlease pay attention to the size chart\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1060-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1061","slug":"motorbike-leather-jacket-green-pcp-lj-1061","name":"Motorbike Leather Jacket – Green","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The jacket is made from genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is green\n\nThe surface has been given a used look\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets\n\nAll pockets are equipped with a zip\n\nThe thermal inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nA connecting zip has been sewn into the jacket\n\nSo you can use any trousers as a connection\n\nThe counterpart for sewing in is included in the scope of delivery\n\n5 protector pockets on the shoulders, elbow and back\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nThere is a Velcro fastener on the sides to adjust the waist\n\nThere is a zip under the Velcro fastener for expansion\n\nEach side can be extended by up to 5 cm\n\nAll zips are from the company YKK\n\nPlease pay attention to the size chart\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1061-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1075","slug":"motorbike-retro-leather-jacket-blue-pcp-lj-1075","name":"Motorbike Retro Leather Jacket – Blue","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The jacket is made from genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is blue\n\nThe surface has been given a used look\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets\n\nAll pockets are equipped with a zip\n\nThe thermal inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nA connecting zip has been sewn into the jacket\n\nSo you can use any trousers as a connection\n\nThe counterpart for sewing in is included in the scope of delivery\n\n5 protector pockets on the shoulders, elbow and back\n\nThere is a Velcro fastener on the sides to adjust the waist\n\nThere is a zip under the Velcro fastener for expansion\n\nEach side can be extended by up to 5 cm\n\nAll zips are from the company YKK\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1075-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1051","slug":"matt-black-nubuck-motorbike-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-1051","name":"Matt Black Nubuck Motorbike Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"The jacket is made from genuine buffalo nubuck leather with a thickness of approx. 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nThe leather is thick, but very soft and comfortable to wear\n\nBoth shoulders are quilted\n\nThey have a fastener on both sides for adjustment so that the jacket does not flap while riding\n\nThey have 2 inside pockets, one of which is equipped with a zip\n\nIn addition, they have 4 outside pockets, all 4 can be closed with a zip\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\nAt the collar they have a buckle for adjustment\n\nA piece of leather is used under the zip so that the jacket is windproof\n\nTailored men's cut (slim fit)\n\nAll protectors are removable\n\nProtectors on shoulders, elbows and back","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1051-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1088","slug":"motorcycle-pilot-jacket-with-protectors-leather-bomber-jacket-pcp-lj-1088","name":"Motorcycle Pilot Jacket with Protectors – Leather Bomber Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Men’s pilot / bomber leather jacket\n\nMade of genuine cow nappa leather\n\nLeather thickness: 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nBase color: brown\n\nDetachable real sheepskin collar\n\nSheepskin color: beige\n\nSoft and comfortable against the skin\n\nRemovable thermal inner lining with zipper\n\nLining made of polyester\n\nUnder the thermal lining is a breathable mesh\n\nOutside: Two slit pockets / two zip pockets\n\nInside: One zip pocket / one snap pocket\n\nSmall zip pocket on the left sleeve\n\nSuitable for everyday use and for motorcycling\n\nZipper inside to connect the jacket to pants – usable as a combo suit\n\nLeather strip over the main zipper keeps the jacket windproof\n\nStraps at cuffs and waistband for the classic bomber look\"","material":"Genuine leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1088-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1084","slug":"men-s-retro-motorbike-leather-jacket-cream-white-pcp-lj-1084","name":"Men's Retro Motorbike Leather Jacket – Cream White","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The style of the old days and the technology of today offers an ultra-smart look with a straight, body-hugging cut and the quilted shoulders with typical arm rings are beautifully accentuated.\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning in a stylish way\n\nBasic colour: White / cream white\n\nMaterial: Genuine cowhide nappa leather\n\nLeather stability: 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nOff-centre front zip\n\nFour front pockets with zip\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one of which has a zip\n\nZip fastening on the cuffs\n\nAll outside zips are YKK robust metal zips\n\nInner lining:- Polyester, removable black quilted lining\n\nMaximum safety thanks to super strong materials and prepared protector pockets with protectors on the back, elbows and shoulders\n\nJacket is made from genuine, robust, high-quality, soft cowhide leather\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, elbows and back\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1084-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1076","slug":"motorbike-leather-jacket-with-motif-and-protectors-pcp-lj-1076","name":"Motorbike Leather Jacket with Motif and Protectors","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"The outside of the jacket is made of genuine cowhide nappa leather\n\nWith a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThick yet soft leather\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\nPerforated cowhide leather on the arms and back (for ventilation)\n\nThe removable inner lining consists of a polyester / cotton mix\n\nThe inner lining in the jacket is made of an air-permeable polyester\n\n3 buckles on each side to adjust the width of the waist\n\n3 outer zip pockets\n\n1 small press stud outside pocket\n\n2 inside pockets (one is equipped with a zip)\n\nConnecting zip for the trousers\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1076-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-168","slug":"men-s-motorcycle-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-168","name":"Men's Motorcycle Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"\"Jacket made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe jacket is dark brown and finished with brown accents\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nThe jacket can be tightened on both sides with a hook-and-loop fastener so it doesn't flap while riding\n\nTwo arm pockets\n\nOff-centered front zipper\n\nAll exterior zippers are YKK robust metal zippers\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, it can be maintained with everyday care products such as care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nTwo front zippered pockets\n\nWith protectors on the shoulders, elbows, and back\n\nAll protectors are removable\"","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-168-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-169","slug":"men-s-motorcycle-leather-jacket-with-a-used-look-pcp-lj-169","name":"Men's Motorcycle Leather Jacket with a Used Look","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"Jacket made of genuine, robust cowhide, with a leather thickness of approximately 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe jacket is dark brown and finished with brown accents\n\nAlso ideal for club logos and/or patches\n\nThe inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nOff-center front zipper\n\nAll exterior zippers are YKK robust metal zippers\n\nVery simple and easy to care for, can be maintained with everyday care products such as care lotion, care cream, leather grease, leather oil, leather balm, leather spray, etc. The leather remains supple and permanently soft.\n\nTwo front zippered pockets","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-169-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-125","slug":"motorcycle-leather-jacket-pcp-lj-125","name":"Motorcycle Leather Jacket","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"Jacket made of genuine, robust, high-quality, soft cowhide\n\nExcellent quality and workmanship\n\nComfortable to wear\n\nWith this jacket , fashionistas create the trendy biker look.\n\nTimeless model offers an ultra-stylish look\n\nThe jacket also looks stunning, in a stylish way\n\nBase color: Black\n\nMaterial: 100% COWHIDE\n\nLeather strength: 1.1 mm to 1.2 mm\n\nSlanted zippers\n\nThe jacket can also be closed with two snap fasteners\n\nFour front pockets with zippers\n\nTwo deep inside pockets, one with a zipper\n\nZipper closure on the cuffs\n\nAll external zippers are YKK robust metal zippers\n\nProtectors on the back, elbows, and shoulders\n\nProtectors are removable","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-125-1.jpg"],"featured":false},{"sku":"PCP-LJ-1062","slug":"motorbike-jacket-made-of-genuine-leather-black-pcp-lj-1062","name":"Motorbike Jacket Made of Genuine Leather – Black","category":"Men's Jacket","categorySlug":"men-s-jacket","description":"The jacket is made from genuine cowhide leather\n\nThe leather has a thickness of 1.1 to 1.2 mm\n\nThe basic colour of the leather is black\n\n4 outside pockets\n\n2 inside pockets\n\nAll pockets are equipped with a zip\n\nThe thermal inner lining is made of polyester and is removable\n\nA connecting zip has been sewn into the jacket\n\nSo you can use any trousers as a connection\n\nThe counterpart for sewing in is included in the scope of delivery\n\n5 protector pockets on the shoulders, elbow and back\n\nWith protectors on shoulders, back and elbows\n\nThere is a Velcro fastener on the sides to adjust the waist\n\nThere is a zip under the Velcro fastener for expansion\n\nEach side can be extended by up to 5 cm\n\nAll zips are from the company YKK\n\nPlease pay attention to the size chart","material":"Genuine cowhide leather","moq":"50","colors":["Black","Brown","Tan","Custom Colors"],"sizes":["S","M","L","XL","2XL","3XL","4XL"],"tags":[],"images":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/primecraftpartners/PrimeCraft-Partners-Catalogue/main/Images/PCP-LJ-1062-1.jpg"],"featured":false}],"fixedCollection":"men-s-jacket"}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"relative overflow-hidden bg-ink py-16 text-white","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"absolute inset-y-0 right-0 hidden w-1/3 bg-[linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(201,149,60,0.28),rgba(138,90,51,0.08))] lg:block"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"container-pad relative flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-center lg:justify-between","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-2xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"eyebrow mb-3 text-brass","children":"Private Label Manufacturing"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-3xl font-black leading-tight sm:text-5xl","children":"Develop your men's jacket line with PrimeCraft Partners"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-xl text-base leading-7 text-white/72","children":"From neck labels and hang tags to custom packaging and production-ready leather apparel, PrimeCraft Partners helps turn your brand into a complete private label line."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-col","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/contact#quote","className":"btn-gold","children":[["$","svg",null,{"xmln